interface "aewuhlykb4djugeyihokemzb4m4guuz7hjtiyq2gkjk4klzku3x4isr"
doc "aewuhlykb4djugeyihokemzb4m4guuz7hjtiyq2gkjk4klzku3x4isr" "How a job or a component instance ended: the encoding of a job's result, of a host-compatible\nentry's exit status as a `u8` or of an instance's last state, the rendering of a job's failure\nor of the failure building an instance's Env, a cancellation it failed with, the abandoner of\nits domain abandoning it, another trap abandoning its domain, or an input or checkpoint its\nentry does not decode."
